{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1211015001:1":{"text":"힘들어 죽겠네... 그래도 고생한 덕에 드디어 3종류의 물고기를 모두 잡았어!","source_cn":"累死了……费了这么大劲，总算钓齐了三种鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC57FE72D7EC1345","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211015002:1":{"text":"날이 어두워졌으니, 물고기는 일단 웅덩이에 넣어두자.","source_cn":"天都黑了，先放在水洼里养着吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D1A3A4D95CBCDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211015003:1":{"text":"그럼 이제 이 물고기를 어디로 보내야 하나요?","source_cn":"接下来，我们要把这些鱼送去哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8B4A39B13FE6AAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211015004:1":{"text":"똑똑한 고블린이 공주님에게 보내라고 했으니까, 날이 밝으면 다시 찾아보자고.","source_cn":"那个智慧过人的咕布林说要送给公主，等天亮了再去找找吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3C4831F6D7278D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211015005:1":{"text":"공주님 이야기는 나도 들어봤어! 용감한 기사가 잠에 빠진 공주님을 찾아서 깨워주는 이야기!","source_cn":"我听过公主的故事！勇敢的骑士找到了公主，把她从梦境里唤醒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE720D262F76681","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211015006:1":{"text":"그리고... 공주님은 검을 들고 사악한 용을 쓰러뜨리는 거지!","source_cn":"然后——公主拿起刀，把恶龙打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A769C4443BC2907","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211015007:1":{"text":"응? 그런 동화가 있어요? 처음 들어보는데...","source_cn":"咦，这是什么童话故事？没听说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE09C8B9C987E08D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211015008:1":{"text":"소니아 언니가 자기 전에 읽어준 이야기야!","source_cn":"是索尼娅姐姐给我讲的睡前故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E68843D3E8F2EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211015009:1":{"text":"크흠.... 내가 지어낸 거야.","source_cn":"咳……我随口编的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8963F7BCC9B81F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1211015010:1":{"text":"난 소니아 언니가 해주는 이야기를 좋아해! 풀잎 요정님이 상어를 잡아먹는 이야기나, 나무꾼이 도끼를 만들어서 건달들을 잡는 이런 이야기 말이야!","source_cn":"我很喜欢听索尼娅姐姐讲故事！无论是草仙子吃掉鲨鱼……还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DB2605241A5231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211015011:1":{"text":"소니아, 동생에게 대체 무슨 이야기를 들려준 거야... 너 생각보다 훨씬 더 재미있는 사람이었구나?","source_cn":"索尼娅，你给你妹妹讲的都是些什么故事啊……嘿，你比我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2A4B833DCF598B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211015012:1":{"text":"전부 블러디 로즈에 가입하기 훨씬 전의 일이라 나는 기억이 안 나는데, 나라는 전부 기억하고 있더라고.","source_cn":"那都是加入血薇帮很久以前的事了，我都记不清，她居然还记得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EE338CE30402F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1211015013:1":{"text":"이 이야기는 이제 그만하자. 여기서 밤을 보내려면 먼저 모닥불을 피워야 해.","source_cn":"不说这些了，如果要在这里过夜，我们得先把篝火燃起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA358CD7B233FA297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1211015014:1":{"text":"도와줄게.","source_cn":"我来帮忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1EFD0CA0A695EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211015015:1":{"text":"저도 도울게요!","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8B3E3F70D9C64E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_fl